WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Give Downloads a second look.
Installers. Possible duplicates. Older files. A clear place to start your review.
You choose what stays.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A quick look. A closer look.
See your Downloads summary. Browse one suggestion at a time, right from the menu bar.
Open the full review when you’re ready.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.500
Installed it? Check the installer.
A matching app appears installed. Check whether you still need its disk image.
A useful reason to review the file.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Same contents. Your choice.
SHA-256 content checks identify matching downloads. Compare the copies and decide which to keep.
Nothing is selected automatically.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.500
Old export. Still useful?
Find files you haven’t modified in a while. Check the details before deciding.
Age alone doesn’t make a file unwanted.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Keep the file. Clear the suggestion.
Hide a suggestion to leave its file in Downloads. It stays hidden until the file changes or you restore it.
Restore suggestions in Review Settings.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Your files. Your call.
Select only what you no longer need. Move to Trash opens a confirmation for your selection.
A suggestion never moves a file.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.000
One last look. Then decide.
Check the selected filename. Confirm when you’re ready, or cancel and keep reviewing.
Demo ends here, before a file moves.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Less clutter. More control.
File review is free. Start at trayage.app.
Recover files before emptying Trash. Trayage never empties it.

